values
  ('CV', 'exempt', 'exempt', 'Isento de IVA', '{}'::jsonb, 10, date '1970-01-01', null, 'Código do IVA, article 9 (exempt operations) and article 13 (exports): the invoice states the reason the tax is not applied (article 32(5)(e), as printed in the 2015 republication). The exact wording to print is the pack''s, not the law''s.')
